@startuml
[*] --> Displaying Saved Queries List

Displaying Saved Queries List --> Creating New Query : User clicks "Create New Query"
Creating New Query --> Displaying Saved Queries List : Query saved

Displaying Saved Queries List --> Editing Query : User selects query and clicks "Edit"
Editing Query --> Displaying Saved Queries List : Query edited

Displaying Saved Queries List --> Deleting Query : User selects query and clicks "Delete"
Deleting Query --> Displaying Saved Queries List : Query deleted

Displaying Saved Queries List --> Filtering by Tags : User selects tag from dropdown
Filtering by Tags --> Displaying Saved Queries List : Filter applied

Displaying Saved Queries List --> [*] : User closes feature
@enduml
